# Help: The Rust DMA sample
#
# samples/rust/rust_dma.rs, a PCI driver mapping coherent memory and a
# scatterlist through the kernel crate's dma and scatterlist modules,
# alone; rust/rust-samples-all.config builds it with the rest.
#
# Prerequisites inlined per the self-containment rule: rust.config's
# RUST and the RANDSTRUCT_NONE it requires, and PCI.
#
# Layer builtin/rust/rust-sample-dma.config to build it in (=y).
# See: samples/rust/Kconfig
CONFIG_RANDSTRUCT_NONE=y
CONFIG_RUST=y
CONFIG_PCI=y
CONFIG_SAMPLES=y
CONFIG_SAMPLES_RUST=y
CONFIG_SAMPLE_RUST_DMA=m
